{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》最新一集引爆激烈爭論，一碗盛惠388港元的五星酒店「黯然銷魂飯」挑戰食家底線！黎諾懿大讚好味願意付款，李家鼎卻狠批另一間酒店版本失傳統特色。究竟天價叉燒飯值唔值，名廚一句話竟令全場拍掌？\n</p>\n<h2>廣州酒店奄列版黯然銷魂飯 李家鼎嘆失特色</h2>\n<p>節目中，戰火首先蔓延至廣州一間五星級酒店，其售價約57港元的黯然銷魂飯，竟將傳統的煎蛋換成了奄列，此舉立即引來李家鼎大嘆失卻了應有的味道和特色，他直言：「（個蛋）冇脆邊，整個和尚戴帽你話 Buy 唔 Buy 喇！」雖然內地食店主理人「飯冰冰」同樣覺得叉燒飯本身未如理想，但他力撐該酒店的其他出品水準極高，特別是點心：「其他出品都好食過呢個好多」。名廚周世韜亦補充指該處的點心確實出色，形容是「點心蝦餃一絕」。</p>\n<h2>尖沙咀388蚊天價叉燒飯 黎諾懿激讚：成件事昇華晒</h2>\n<p>鏡頭一轉，另一碗來自尖沙咀五星酒店、盛惠388港元的「黯然銷魂飯」更是將爭議推向高峰。這碗飯的賣點是用火槍燒炙叉燒、配搭蘋果木煙肉油，並選用最高級的意大利雞蛋，再配上無敵維港海景。雖然定價極高，但評審對食物質素近乎一致好評，黎諾懿更是大讚物有所值：「每個細節都做得好好，佢就係多咗火炙呢種獨特嘅味道，同埋佢個飯真係好好食，溝咗個油後成件事昇華晒，所以我係願意去畀（呢個價錢）。」</p>\n<h2>李金凱胡孟青激辯價值觀：好似同富家女談戀愛</h2>\n<p>天價叉燒飯隨即引發價值觀的激辯，李金凱就打趣形容對這碗飯的感覺，坦言雖然美味但價錢令人卻步：「好想回頭去食，但我唔敢，好似同一個富家女談戀愛，我好愛你，但係我養你唔起吖嘛！」另一邊廂，胡孟青雖認同叉燒煎蛋飯不應該是這個價錢，但她認為用餐體驗亦是價值的一部分，能夠對著國際級的維港靚景進食，本身就是一大賣點：「對住個咁靚嘅維港景，好開心好舒服，食一餐飯唔止食飯咁簡單。」</p>\n<h2>名廚邵德龍一番話撐創新 引爆全場掌聲</h2>\n<p>在眾人激辯之際，名廚邵德龍則從廚師的角度出發，呼籲大家尊重創新，他的一番話更引爆全場掌聲：「我想大家思考一個問題，傳統嘅叉燒係點樣燒出嚟嘅？係用柴火燒出嚟嘅。點解依家轉咗用電、用煤氣去燒，你哋可以接受，就唔能夠接受一個西餐師傅用火槍去噴呢？其實好與唔好，我哋都應該去尊重。喺呢一點上嚟講，我覺得我敬佩個師傅」。他最後總結道：「其實我哋應該要打破地域性、區域性呢啲框架，畀我哋有諗法嘅廚師，用佢哋嘅方法多啲去發揮。我哋多啲去鼓勵，等佢哋日後做得更好。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_7381889756ae9556b3aafc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_7381889756ae9556b3aafc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_10871987526ae95570913f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_10871987526ae95570913f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14361212006ae95573bfc4d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14361212006ae95573bfc4d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_3349792656ae9557a16d8c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_3349792656ae9557a16d8c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_581383026ae9559dca49f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_581383026ae9559dca49f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_16195261056ae955a0d75e3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_16195261056ae955a0d75e3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14938271466ae955a48a2f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14938271466ae955a48a2f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_11728568336ae955aa39407.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_11728568336ae955aa39407.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_11150950076ae955be65d7f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_11150950076ae955be65d7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:26.184838+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1311,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK"